    <string name="privacy_dialog_body">" &lt;p>Read our &lt;a href=redirect://privacy> Privacy Policy&lt;/a>. Tap Agree and Continue to accept the &lt;a href=redirect://protocol> Terms of Service&lt;/a > &lt;/p> &lt;p>By accepting the Terms of Service and using our product, a specific set of users' device data, including information like: &lt;/p > &lt;p>&lt;b>Installed applications&lt;/b>&lt;br/>We collect and keep basic information on the apps installed on your device when you use Clone Master. This helps us generate a personalized list of compatible apps that can be cloned. Rest assured that this data is anonymous, does not include personally identifiable information, and will never be shared with third parties.&lt;/p > &lt;p>&lt;b>Crash Logs&lt;/b>&lt;br/>We keep records of and store logs related to the crashes that users encounter while using the Clone Master. These logs include details such as the type of error, the time when the error occurred, and general information about the device. Gathering crash information is essential for us to gain a better understanding of the issues users face during their normal use of our service. This enables us to address technical problems more efficiently. It is important to note that crash logs do not contain any personal information.&lt;/p > "</string>
